Package: com.minis.statusbarmover
Name: StatusBarMover
Version: 1.0.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Move each status bar icon independently with a per-item X/Y offset (applied as a non-destructive transform). Includes a Settings pane, live icon discovery, and a kill-switch file. SpringBoard-only, crash-hardened, defers prefs out of dylib ctor. iOS 15.x rootless (XinaA15 / xina2).
Maintainer: you
Author: you
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
